/-!
# KFM Cost: the cost of `bigE` in the unit `ZU`

`ZU n = T (p + 1 + fmB (8p)) + (b + 1)^6 + n`. Every cost of `bigE` other than the three
interfaces is `O(ZU n)`:

* `wU_le`, `wFR_le`, `sCmp_le_T`, `mN_le`: sizes;
* `kShl_le`, `cMvN_le'`, `kGm_le`, `kCj_le`, `kFinA_le`, `cCarU_le'`, `kDig_le`: the passes;
* `desc_le`: the descriptor parts of the calls;
* `setC_le`: the setup.
-/

set_option linter.unusedSimpArgs false
set_option linter.unusedVariables false

namespace NLogN.KFM

